Subject: [PATCH 71/71] Meridian: after a layout fix, macOS types the rest in
 that layout

The command bar asks SwitchKeyboardLayout for an enabled input source of
the meant language (TISSelectInputSource). Test browsers
(--meridian-keep-keyboard-layout) leave the keyboard alone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
